<dive number='2' tags='wreck, technical, deco, deep' divesiteid='00000002' date='2024-05-12' time='12:30:00' duration='55:00 min' rating='5'>
  <divemaster>Yann</divemaster>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>Le Donator in the afternoon, flat sea and no current on the line. Air on
the back, Nx70 from 6 m. Propeller first, then a slow pass over the holds.
Long hang, ran the deco exactly as planned with 110 bar left in the 70.</notes>
  <suit>7mm wetsuit</suit>
  <cylinder size='15.0 l' workpressure='232.0 bar' description='steel 15' start='230.0 bar' end='74.0 bar' />
  <cylinder size='11.1 l' workpressure='207.0 bar' description='AL80 Nx70' o2='70.0%' start='200.0 bar' end='110.0 bar' />
  <weightsystem weight='5.0 kg' description='belt' />
  <divetemperature air='25.0 C' water='18.0 C' />
  <divecomputer model='Shearwater Perdix' deviceid='1a2b3c4d' diveid='00000002' duration='55:00 min'>
  <depth max='47.6 m' mean='31.2 m' />
