<trip date='2024-06-02' time='08:30:00' location='Cavalaire'>
<dive number='3' tags='wreck, technical, deco' divesiteid='00000003' date='2024-06-02' time='09:30:00' duration='50:00 min' rating='5'>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>Le Rubis, the old submarine. Air and Nx70 again, same plan as the Var
wrecks. Deck at 41 m, conning tower a bit shallower. Vis was close to 25 m.</notes>
