<trip date='2024-08-09' time='09:00:00' location='Groix'>
<dive number='5' tags='wreck, technical, trimix, deco' divesiteid='00000005' date='2024-08-09' time='10:00:00' duration='46:00 min' rating='5'>
  <divemaster>Erwan</divemaster>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>U-171 in Brittany, cold and green with a proper current. Trimix 21/35 on
the back, Nx50 from 21 m and Nx70 from 6 m. Dry suit and two deco stages.
The hull is intact but the conning tower is covered in dead men&#39;s fingers.</notes>
  <suit>dry suit</suit>
  <cylinder size='15.0 l' workpressure='232.0 bar' description='steel 15 Tx21/35' o2='21.0%' he='35.0%' start='230.0 bar' end='95.0 bar' />
  <cylinder size='11.1 l' workpressure='207.0 bar' description='AL80 Nx50' o2='50.0%' start='210.0 bar' end='165.0 bar' />
  <cylinder size='11.1 l' workpressure='207.0 bar' description='AL80 Nx70' o2='70.0%' start='200.0 bar' end='150.0 bar' />
  <weightsystem weight='8.0 kg' description='belt' />
  <divetemperature air='17.0 C' water='14.0 C' />
  <divecomputer model='Shearwater Perdix 2' deviceid='2b3c4d5e' diveid='00000005' duration='46:00 min' dctype='OC' no_o2sensors='0'>
