<dive number='6' tags='wreck, technical, deco' divesiteid='00000006' date='2024-08-09' time='14:30:00' duration='44:00 min' rating='4'>
  <divemaster>Erwan</divemaster>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>Le Cyrano on Nx32 with Nx70 for the hang. Shallower than the U-boat so
the stops were short. Lots of life on the wreck, and a friendly conger in
one of the open holds.</notes>
  <suit>dry suit</suit>
  <cylinder size='15.0 l' workpressure='232.0 bar' description='steel 15 Nx32' o2='32.0%' start='220.0 bar' end='80.0 bar' />
