<dive number='7' tags='reef, night' divesiteid='00000007' date='2024-08-10' time='21:00:00' duration='38:20 min' rating='5'>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>Dusk dive on La Horaine once the current dropped. Nx32, shallow and slow.
Kelp everywhere, spider crabs and a cuttlefish that stayed with us for ten
minutes. Water was 14 C, dry suit was worth it.</notes>
  <suit>dry suit</suit>
  <cylinder size='12.0 l' workpressure='232.0 bar' description='AL80 Nx32' o2='32.0%' start='200.0 bar' end='90.0 bar' />
  <weightsystem weight='8.0 kg' description='belt' />
