<trip date='2025-01-18' time='09:00:00' location='Port-Cros'>
<dive number='8' tags='reef, rebreather, deco' divesiteid='00000008' date='2025-01-18' time='10:00:00' duration='55:00 min' rating='5'>
  <divemaster>Yann</divemaster>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>First proper rebreather dive on the Gabinière drop-off. Diluent 10/50,
setpoint 1.3 in the water and 0.7 on the surface. Three O2 sensors within
0.03 bar of each other all dive. Gorgonians and a very relaxed grouper.</notes>
  <suit>7mm wetsuit</suit>
  <cylinder size='3.0 l' workpressure='232.0 bar' description='diluent 10/50' o2='10.0%' he='50.0%' use='diluent' start='200.0 bar' end='118.0 bar' />
