<dive number='10' tags='lake, freshwater, training' divesiteid='00000009' date='2025-03-15' time='10:00:00' duration='41:00 min' rating='3'>
  <buddy>Sam</buddy>
  <notes>Freshwater dive in Lac d&#39;Annecy, 447 m altitude. Cold and very clear:
you could see the barge from the surface. Buoyancy and reel work on the
platform, then a lap of the wreck. Air, 12 L, dry suit.</notes>
