<dive number='11' tags='wreck, technical, deco, deep' divesiteid='00000002' date='2025-04-06' time='08:00:00' duration='57:00 min' rating='5'>
  <divemaster>Yann</divemaster>
  <buddy>Camille</buddy>
  <notes>Back on Le Donator with the same air and Nx70 plan as last year. Flat
sea, good light and no current. Spent more time on the stern this time.
